.TH pinta 1 "" "Pinta.NET" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pinta \- Pinta.NET image editor (fork of Pinta)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pinta
.I [<file_name>]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Pinta.NET is an independent fork of the Pinta drawing and image-editing program. It presents
under the name Pinta.NET so users do not confuse it with the upstream Pinta project.
.PP
It is modeled on Paint.NET-style workflows: layers, adjustments, effects, and common raster tools.
Upstream documentation may help with shared features but does not constitute support for this fork.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B file_name
Optional. Image file for Pinta.NET to open.
.SH SUPPORT
Report bugs and request help only via the Pinta.NET project repository:
\fBhttps://github.com/TandyColorComputer3/Pinta-dotNet\fR
.PP
Do not use upstream Pinta issue trackers or forums for this program.
.SH AUTHOR
Derived from Pinta (\fBhttps://www.pinta-project.com\fR), led historically by Jonathan Pobst.
Pinta.NET is maintained separately; see repository contributors.
